      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אָשַׁר</span>]</big></big> <strong>v. seguir em linha reta, prosseguir, avançar (</strong>assírio <em>ašâru</em> Zim<sup>BP 11</sup>; árabe e aramaico nas formas derivadas<strong>)</strong> —<br><strong>Qal.</strong> Imperativo <span dir=\"rtl\">אִשְׁרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.6\">Pr 9:6</a>: <span dir=\"rtl\">אִשְׁרוּ בְדֶרֶךְ בִּינָה</span>, <em>segui em linha reta pelo caminho do entendimento</em>.<br><strong>Piel.</strong> Perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">אִשְּׁרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:12\" href=\"/Malachi.3.12\">Mal 3:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:13\" href=\"/Genesis.30.13\">Gn 30:13</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּאַשֵּׁר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.14\">Pr 4:14</a> + 4 vezes; imperativo <span dir=\"rtl\">אַשֵּׁר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.19\">Pr 23:19</a>; particípio plural <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאַשְּׁרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:15\" href=\"/Malachi.3.15\">Mal 3:15</a> + 2 vezes. — <strong>1.</strong> Intensivo, <em>seguir diretamente, avançar</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.14\">Pr 4:14</a>. <strong>2.</strong> Causativo, <em>conduzir adiante, guiar</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.19\">Pr 23:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.12\">Is 3:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.15\">9:15</a>. <strong>3.</strong> <em>Pôr em ordem, endireitar</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.17\">Is 1:17</a>. <strong>4.</strong> <em>Declarar feliz, chamar bem-aventurado</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:13\" href=\"/Genesis.30.13\">Gn 30:13</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Job 29:11\" href=\"/Job.29.11\">Jb 29:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 72:17\" href=\"/Psalms.72.17\">ψ 72:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.28\">Pr 31:28</a> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:9\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.9\">Ct 6:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:12\" href=\"/Malachi.3.12\">Mal 3:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:15\" href=\"/Malachi.3.15\">15</a>.<br><strong>Pual.</strong> Imperfeito, Ketiv <span dir=\"rtl\">יְאֻשַּׁר</span>, Qerê <span dir=\"rtl\">וְאֻשַּׁר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 41:3\" href=\"/Psalms.41.3\">ψ 41:3</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאֻשָּׁר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.18\">Pr 3:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.15\">Is 9:15</a>. <strong>1.</strong> <em>Ser conduzido adiante</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.15\">Is 9:15</a>. <strong>2.</strong> <em>Ser tornado feliz, ser abençoado</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 41:3\" href=\"/Psalms.41.3\">ψ 41:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.18\">Pr 3:18</a>.",
